# --- Data and JSONs ---
# ignore all the jsons and irrelevant data to the context

**/forecasts/**



# --- Environment and Dependencies ---
# Ignore the virtual environment directory (the most important exclusion)
# This directory often contains thousands of files and is irrelevant to the AI.
# Common names are '.venv' or 'venv'
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# --- Build and Distribution Files ---
# Ignore compiled Python files
**/*.pyc
**/__pycache__/

# Ignore packaging and distribution files
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
**/.eggs/

# --- Configuration and Metadata ---
# Ignore common editor/IDE configuration directories
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/

# Ignore general development metadata
**/.git/
**/.hg/
**/.svn/

# --- Logs and Outputs ---
# Ignore log files and temporary output
*.log
*.tmp
# Ignore Jupyter notebook checkpoint folders
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Web Framework Specific (if applicable) ---
# Ignore static asset build/output directories often used by web frameworks
# e.g., for Django or Flask projects when using front-end build tools
**/static_root/
**/media_root/